ojana)\" [level=3]\n      - text: \"Financial / Equipment Benefit : · Comprehensive risk insurance covering yield losses due to non-preventable natural risks (drought, flood, hailstorm, pests). Farmer pays only 2% for Kharif, 1.5% for Rabi. · Eligibility Criteria : · All farmers growing notified crops in notified areas including sharecroppers and tenant farmers.\"\n      - button \"View Application Steps\" [ref=e81] [cursor=pointer] [offscreen]\n    - generic:\n      - text: Up to 60% Solar Subsidy\n      - heading \"PM-KUSUM (Solar Agri Pump & Grid Subsidy)\" [level=3]\n      - text: \"Financial / Equipment Benefit : · Government subsidy of up to 60% for installing standalone solar agriculture pumps (3HP to 7.5HP) and solarizing existing grid-connected electric pumps. · Eligibility Criteria : · Farmers with agricultural land possessing an existing borewell/well requiring irrigation.\"\n      - button \"View Application Steps\" [ref=e82] [cursor=pointer] [offscreen]\n    - generic:\n      - text: Free Soil Nutrient Testing\n      - heading \"Soil Health Card Scheme (National Mission)\" [level=3]\n      - text: \"Financial / Equipment Benefit : · Free periodic testing of 12 critical soil parameters (N, P, K, S, Zn, Fe, Cu, Mn, Bo, pH, EC, OC) with customized crop-specific fertilizer dosage prescriptions. · Eligibility Criteria : · All agricultural landholders in rural panchayats across India.\"\n      - button \"View Application Steps\" [ref=e83] [cursor=pointer] [offscreen]\n- contentinfo:\n  - text: AgriSense · KrishiMitra • कृषि मित्र • কৃষি মিত্ৰ · AgriSense (KrishiMitra) is dedicated to advancing sustainable, climate-smart farming through accessible digital tools, localized agronomy, and real-time market transparency. · Offline-Ready Mode Active\n  - heading \"Quick Navigation\" [level=4]\n  - listitem:\n    - link \"Home\" [ref=e84] [cursor=pointer] [offscreen]:\n      - /url: http://127.0.0.1:5173/#hero\n  - listitem:\n    - link \"Crop Recommender\" [ref=e85]